  "shortDescription": "Following my dream of creating great dishes & cooking with passion to feed the hungry!",
  "projectStory": "Project story\nCreator\nDAN FOWLER\nmore infocontact\nCategory\nLocal Businesses\nTags\nother\nBacking information\nCrowdfunding risks\nlearn more\nOur Mission\nHi, my name is Dan & I have the dream of owning a restaurant in a small community.  I have the hope of building strong community ties & promoting healthy lifestyle choices in our children, as well as helping to bring families closer together.\nI strive to bring people the best food & service their money can buy.  Part of my dream is giving back to the community as a whole, by revitalizing the local economy.  This can be accomplished through giving free culinary lessons to the community and contributing to the local schools with programs involving local businesses.  In addition to the culinary education, I will also be sponsoring local youth sports to promote a healthy lifestyle.\nIn recent years it has become a thing of the past in many families for them to sit down to a meal together.  Sadly this has lead to a breakdown of the family unit in America, which could be at the heart of many issues that have become a topic of local & national news & debate.  Such as the increase of obesity in our youth, school shootings, the decline of grade point averages in our schools & several other points of concern.\nI also have the dream of offering a community service in the form of providing FREE meals to low-income families so they can enjoy fine, healthy dining thereby increasing the amount of quality time families spend together.  This will give the opportunity to experience and participate in family time that may not be available otherwise.\nBy helping fund us you will be helping to better a small town in many ways:\nStimulating the local economy\nBringing food education to the community\nSupporting FREE cooking lessons at the restaurant\nHelping us provide FREE meals to low income families\nSponsoring Local Youth Sports Team(s)\n\n\nWhat is Needed & What You Get\nWhen our goal is reached it will be used toward the purchase of the building & land for the restaurant & gardens.  It will also help fund the Free cooking classes & Food education classes & Community Outreach for the local schools.  In addition it will also help in the sponsoring of the youth sports team(s) as well.\nFor every donation of $20 or more you will receive a great gift, be it a Free Dinner, Dinner for Two, Dinner for four, Breakfast or even a dish named after you on the menu!**\nEven if our goal is not reached we will use all available funds to advance our goals to the maximum potential.\n\n\n\nThe Impact You Have By Helping\nIn addition to helping the local schools with meals & support, you will also be helping to fund the classes we will be offering for children & their families on growing their own fresh produce & herbs organically at no cost to them. \n\n\nYou will also be helping to aid us in funding the FREE culinary & nutrition education classes for children & their families to help promote healthy lifestyle choices on a long term basis through having the knowledge of good foods & eating habits.\nAll of these programs are designed to not only educate & entertain, but to help to strengthen the family bond.\nBy helping fund us you are not only helping a small town, but helping to bring families closer together!\n\n\nOther Ways You Can Help\nEven if you can't donate you can still help:\nBy spreading the word about us!\nLike us on Facebook\nShare our campaign with the Indiegogo share tools!\nIf you're in our area you can volunteer to help with community programs we will be offering!\nThank you for your support!!\n**All Gift Perks will be distributed by email gift certificates redeemable at our restaurant",
